📘 Week 5: Supervised Learning – Regression
🎯 Objective

The goal of this assignment is to build a baseline regression model on the Customer Churn Dataset using Linear Regression.
You will split the dataset into training and testing sets, train a model, and evaluate it using Mean Absolute Error (MAE) and Root Mean Squared Error (RMSE).

